{"kind": "web_lines", "number": 1, "end_line": 13, "text": "对大跃进报导的指示（一九五八年末于武昌）\n中文马克思主义文库\n->\n毛泽东\n->\n1968年汉版《毛泽东思想万岁》\n102)\n对大跃进报导的指示\n（一九五八年末于武昌）\n要实事求是，不要浮夸。要作冷静的促进派，要鼓实劲，不要鼓虚劲，冲天的干劲要与严格的科学的态度相结合。\n上一页\n目录\n下一页\n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-8bf1caaffed0ec84f9c2", "source_url": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/4-102.htm", "source_raw_sha256": "1f2255074ad8f68490712abe201ca7d2273bf24b2e57ce801040e82269534cfc", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "mia-1968", "volume": 4, "basis": "source_catalogue_not_print_collation"}], "source_text_sha256": "ebd87d803740eb79b17a4bd9a2aefc1674a00051ca3ece2ac94efc38bfab4ca9", "text_chars": 147}
